1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
One walkthrough, start to finish — the real, running app.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Someone on the team starts by creating the project.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Name, group, and teammates, comma-separated, no separate invite step.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Describe the project in plain English, that's all the AI needs.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Specific to this project, not generic tags like teamwork or communication.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,500
A real join link and QR code, ready to send to the team.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Meanwhile, a teammate joins with that same link, paste it, type their name, done.

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Once every member submits, tasks are distributed automatically, by skill fit and balanced workload.

9
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,000
The project is live: tasks assigned, deadline tracked, dashboard ready for everyone.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Falling more than 20% behind the group's pace flags a member automatically, the nudge.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,500
This is the falling-behind flag in action, automatic, visible to the whole team, no one has to call it out.

12
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Everyone in the group shares one live chat feed.

13
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:59,000
One-on-one messages stay separate from the group feed.

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,500
Files upload straight into the group's shared library, tagged by who uploaded them.

15
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:09,000
The assistant retrieves the most relevant chunks from your uploaded files and cites the source, grounded answers, not guesses.

16
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,500
A quick, no-shame way to flag you're stuck, it shows up for teammates on Offer Help.

17
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Anyone on the team can step in, open requests are visible to everyone, not just the admin.

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,500
Dark mode, admin-approved member removal, and a confirmed Leave Group, nothing destructive happens by accident.

19
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:27,500
Built with Gradio, Supabase, and the OpenAI API.

